---
title: "Mountain running"
---

### **The emerging discipline**

Running through unspoilt mountain nature over long distances, for pure pleasure or to test yourself in competitions. Finding your limits and surpassing them with training, dedication and consistency.

Crossing the finish line to the applause of the spectators after months of hard preparation will give you unique emotions.

We practise on the hills behind our homes, and go as far as the routes of the most prestigious races in the Alps.

It is the group's newest discipline, and the number of runners is growing fast.

##### **Activities:**

We provide official CONI membership to take part in the main trail and road races in Italy and abroad, and we organise training camps, evening training sessions and evenings on training and nutrition.
